# ===== A. 上游 RULE-SET 引用(自动更新,无需手写) =====
# blackmatrix7 Advertising.list 已在模块中,此处不再重复
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Moli-X/Tool/main/Loon/Rules/Reject.list,REJECT

